# Squall, SeeD Mercenary (CR 506.5, 702.4, 510.2, 202.3, 115.1): attacking alone on turn 3 Squall gains double strike and deals 3 + 3
# to Bot2 (20 -> 14). Each combat damage step returns a target permanent card with mana value 3 or less from Bot1's graveyard: Shantotto
# (mana value exactly 3) comes back while Hill Giant (mana value 4), Bot2's Black Lotus and its later discarded Island are not legal targets, so the second damage
# step has none. On turn 5 Squall attacks with Shantotto: not alone, so no double strike, and 3 damage only (14 -> 11).

